      "title": "Semi-Skilled Laborer | Utility Plant",
      "description": "Slippery Rock University | Semi-Skilled Laborer | Utility Plant Skip to Main Content STUDENTS FACULTY AND STAFF ADMINISTRATION ALUMNI, FRIENDS, GIVING PARENTS ADMISSIONS ACADEMICS CAMPUS LIFE ATHLETICS ABOUT SRU NEWS and INFO Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help About SRU Human Resources Diversity and Equal Opportunity Benefits Directions Visitors and Community Semi-Skilled Laborer | Utility Plant Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening. To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Please provide three professional references in the application form. Recommended candidate will be required to complete criminal background checks, including Act 34 (State Police); Act 151 (Child Abuse); and Federal Criminal (FBI) clearance prior to appointment. Slippery Rock University fosters an environment to provide opportunities for advancement. Slippery Rock University provides a comprehensive package of employer benefits to eligible employees and their enrolled dependent(s), which include*: Medical, prescription drug, and supplemental benefits. Generous retirement plans, two options: • Alternative Retirement Plan (ARP) • State Employees’ Retirement System (SERS) Tuition benefits for employees and dependents. Paid time off (holidays, sick leave, annual leave). Employer-paid life insurance. Voluntary insurances and additional retirement programs. *Specific benefits may vary based upon employee group and/or collective bargaining unit Posting Deta